{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/cavaliers-of-mars/1147784-cavaliers-of-mars-and-cthulhu","id":1147784,"title":"Cavaliers of Mars and Cthulhu","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Cavaliers of Mars"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-07T08:57:32-07:00","id":1147784,"title":"Cavaliers of Mars and Cthulhu","content":"Reading through the material and thoughts of the dying planet (with a healthy dose of the last Laundry Files book I read (The Nightmare Stacks)) I am wonder if mixing in some fun and fuzzy Cthulhu Mythos might add to the game ... just weird thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T09:44:10-07:00","id":1148040,"title":"","content":"Hmmm...interesting idea. What were you thinking?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T19:12:56-07:00","id":1148196,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=EldritchMinister;n1148040]Hmmm...interesting idea. What were you thinking?[/QUOTE<br /> <br /> Oh just general end of the world dark times evil cult things based around the great old ones. I would need to see a copy of the lore to really put something down. In The Nightmare Stacks thew world the elves came from was a dying world due to them basically summoning in old ones .. soooo i was thinking it might work.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T17:10:51-07:00","id":1148708,"title":"","content":"The Titus Crow series does goes straight up Burroughs in Spawn of the Winds, which mostly focuses on Ithaqua.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T20:46:05-07:00","id":1152385,"title":"","content":"ok so not seeing alot in the background of mars .. i snagged the pdf file they had for the kickstarter. i might have to extrapolate some stuff, though i like nod to the tripods, which means the original martians or first martians might have been the big brain dudes .. who might be still hiding away in those old places.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T05:46:36-07:00","id":1152476,"title":"","content":"I think you could definitely do something with the following questions: What did the First Martians worship? How did they build their technology? How did they come to discover the technology? Were there old cults with the first martians? I mean HP Lovecraft has always had some sci-fi elements to it...creatures that may have stopped on the surfaces of Mars...a mystery cult that potentially unlocked another dimension deep in the tunnels of mars...so on and so forth. I could see it done. If you have any ideas, please let me know, I'd love to collaborate on something like this. I am a kickstarter as well and have the text so I'm well versed in what's been released thus far with the game world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-31T15:50:45-07:00","id":1154534,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.eldritchdark.com/writings/short-stories/231\" target=\"_blank\">The Vaults of Yoh-Vombis</a>, along with loads of stuff written by Clark Ashton Smith, might be just right into the alley you are looking for. Really, check it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T20:32:49-07:00","id":1155927,"title":"","content":"Cool, I shall do so. I also have a copy of Mars for Savage Worlds ... it has some interesting stuff too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T12:52:53-08:00","id":1156133,"title":"","content":"Also, the blighted wasteland of a world that is <a href=\"https://www.rpg.net/reviews/archive/12/12743.phtml\" target=\"_blank\">Marr\u2019d</a>, covered in blood stained sand and dark ambitions, is another thing definitely worth look out for - and mining - if you can find it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T11:23:28-08:00","id":1156415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode